{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0434_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7dd17da020e1bf905454c015cf71663975bb669299987b4d427d37cdc62340f0", "ja": "（奈緒の新しい衣装が出来たので、試着してもらって\nいる。様子を見る限り、気に入ってもらえたようだ）", "zh": "（奈绪的新服装做好了，现在正让她试穿。看她的样子，似乎很喜欢这套服装。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0434_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "af277dbadd4955a44c099869f9bd88ba22e8697ed8d5125487896bfc2248cee4", "ja": "この衣装すごいですね！　見たときは思いっきり\n動けるんやろかって思ったんですけど……", "zh": "这套服装真厉害啊！看到的时候我还想着，不知道能不能尽情活动……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0434_1002_037nao", "source_sha256": "4adde0551dc67bfbbc02e2edacf5ee858819c63789ea9938528b241735a9af9a", "ja": "着心地もめっちゃいいですし、\n軽いしすごい動きやすいです！", "zh": "穿起来也特别舒服，既轻便又非常方便活动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0434_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "c6ccd9450b7961063ee451e9501141e983fcaecb886f3afc79ab0668b0ffd8e0", "ja": "気持ち的にはびゅんびゅん飛び回って\nどこまでも行けそうな感じです！", "zh": "感觉心情上也像是在嗖嗖地飞来飞去，仿佛无论哪里都能去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0434_1004_p", "source_sha256": "636c5b712676c98bd660ad911d8a2ad8e159c1730be7e741ebcdd3545b5a4ccf", "ja": "ははっ、喜んでもらえてよかったよ。\n元気いっぱいで動く奈緒のことを考えて、作ったんだ。", "zh": "哈哈，能让你喜欢真是太好了。\n我想着元气满满、活蹦乱跳的奈绪，才做了这个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0434_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "0397fc0d77c37734fd8ee00626d3617df2a1d2e97e338d285dff4710c56099e6", "ja": "なるほど～！　さすがは{$P$}さん、\n色々考えてますね～♪", "zh": "原来如此～！不愧是{$P$}先生，真是考虑得很周到呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0434_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "4bf72fdbb4b2be6a57b4e4ea5753f9e1e807df8c61e8a1e699cda8f2a04f66ef", "ja": "ほな、私もパフォーマンスで応えんと！\nどんなステージも、思いっきり飛び回りますね♪", "zh": "那么，我也得用表演来回应才行！  \n不管是什么舞台，我都会尽情地飞跃其中哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0434_1007_p", "source_sha256": "bd171480cc227b19e07fa3e8ad5f5910ad0ab07bff61af52d990cdb063c78dc6", "ja": "ああ。目が離せない底なしの明るさと元気さは、\n奈緒の魅力だからな。期待してるぞ！", "zh": "嗯。让人移不开视线、仿佛没有尽头的开朗和活力，正是奈绪的魅力。很期待你的表现！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0434_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "4e3066cfe851e9049e821ffe754ef422df574d14978bdadba761a147074d6ff0", "ja": "えへへ、それなら任せてください！\n盛り上げるんは、メッチャ得意なんで♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，那就交给我吧！\n活跃气氛可是我的强项♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0434_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "1851c9df17b53649016530a0801c138a34221419926f90cc5857c62dc840b4c2", "ja": "でも、その前に！\n盛り上げるために大事なこと、忘れてません？", "zh": "不过在那之前！\n为了活跃气氛的重要事情，你没忘吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0434_1010_p", "source_sha256": "f82930ad3c8f73a2c0ee6a9fe9e62afa9c71f45b8f20e56f12930b68247e0fa1", "ja": "大事なこと？", "zh": "重要的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0434_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "be4f8399bf276c170afe2693d43c6f206cb22f1e2224c66d994e27dc984e23a3", "ja": "はい。いっちばーん大事なことです！\nそれは……。", "zh": "没错。这是最最重要的事！\n那就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0434_1012_p", "source_sha256": "10cc61ad4c679c3547b5183598aea03840e6b5921da25e05a8ca9eba84a49383", "ja": "ごくり……それは？", "zh": "咽……那是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0434_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "6f8ec2af68ce95979c568fdca05de58d8bd2bd685c6d38da3e46dfc1d05c8259", "ja": "{$P$}さんも思いっきり楽しむこと！\n私だけ楽しんでも、つまらないですしね。", "zh": "{$P$}先生也要尽情享受！\n毕竟只有我一个人开心的话，就太没意思了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0434_1014_037nao", "source_sha256": "4f45cb85347766c332fc26585eb98153cba0ddc38fca309aa0b553e09f482adb", "ja": "やっぱりみんなに楽しんでもらうには、\n私らも、根っこから楽しまんとアカンと思うんです。", "zh": "要想让大家也玩得尽兴，\n我觉得咱们自己也得打心底乐在其中才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0434_1015_p", "source_sha256": "366bedc6af02ef5ccce76139e45b07b2a82789793f7ae4918938dc55831526b8", "ja": "ははっ、そうだな。奈緒と一緒に楽しみながら、\n劇場を盛り上げられるように頑張るよ。", "zh": "哈哈，说得对。我要和奈绪一起享受其中，努力让剧场热闹起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0434_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "56a2090e47dcf9082d86a26d4e9143ad9112ed6adea9b39f139742e2efab5196", "ja": "えへへ。私も全力で頑張りますね！\nこんな素敵な衣装も貰っちゃいましたし。", "zh": "嘿嘿。我也会全力以赴的！\n而且还拿到了这么棒的服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0434_1017_037nao", "source_sha256": "b08c38e72824be2bd4d88b7468ba8bae00985775072350bb162bb7f51119015f", "ja": "会場を、みんなの笑顔でい～っぱいにしてみせますから\n楽しみにしててください！", "zh": "我一定会用大家的笑容把会场填得满满的，  \n请期待吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0434_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "4326d6c31fbf0925e7914aeb6f5aa2901f6bcdd68d558bfd0c8a5a6861858766", "ja": "これからも、私と一緒に盛り上げていきましょー！\nう～……わっしょーい♪", "zh": "今后也和我一起把气氛炒热起来吧——！\n呜～……嘿哟——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
